graph LR
    subgraph Inputs
        Manual[Dashboard manual log]
        SyncBtn[Dashboard Sync Strava btn]
        WH[Strava webhook]
    end

    Manual -->|insert activity_logs + update registrations + insert user_milestones| DB[(Postgres)]
    SyncBtn --> ESync[edge strava-sync-manual]
    WH --> EWebhook[edge strava-webhook]
    ESync -->|insert activity_logs idempotent| DB
    EWebhook -->|insert activity_logs idempotent| DB

    DB --> RPC_LB[RPC challenge_leaderboard / global_leaderboard]
    DB --> RPC_HOF[RPC hall_of_fame]
    DB --> Reads[Page reads via service layer or direct supabase]

    RPC_LB --> LBPage[/leaderboard/]
    RPC_HOF --> Home[/]
    Reads --> Dashboard[/dashboard/]
    Reads --> CDetail[/challenges/:slug/]

    Note["Non-atomic risk: Manual path performs 3 separate writes in JS"]:::risk
    Manual --- Note
    classDef risk fill:#fee,stroke:#c00,color:#900;
